                "text": "Here's where we're at: Instead of codifying President Trump\u2019s executive orders, last week the House passed a bill to nullify one of them after moderates teamed up with Democrats on a discharge petition.\n\nThis week, while we are planning to consider a Republican healthcare bill, leadership moved a closed rule, silencing members and not giving them votes on their amendments (including mine). \n\nBecause of this, moderate Republicans signed the Hakeem Jeffries discharge petition and we will now have to consider a Democrat bill extending Biden COVID-era enhanced Obamacare subsidies for 3 years with no reforms.\n\nHave we lost total control of the House?",
